AdMng Watchdog for Debian
=========================

Installation, configuration, operation and decommissioning are described in the
instructions docs/WATCHDOG-LINUX.md of the AD_MNG repository (in Polish).

  Unit:           admng-watchdog.service (journalctl -u admng-watchdog)
  Configuration:  /etc/admng-watchdog/appsettings.json (root:admng-watchdog 0640)
  TLS:            /etc/admng-watchdog/tls/admng-wd.crt, admng-wd.key
  Key credential: /etc/admng-watchdog/credentials/dp-key.cred (root 0600)
  Data:           /var/lib/admng-watchdog (kept on purge)
  Checks:         sudo admng-watchdog --check-config | --health | --smoke-test
